ets" value="<?=e($old['tickets']??'')?>" placeholder="Additional information (optional)"></label><label class="full-span">Profile picture <span class="optional">Optional demo field</span><input type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" data-demo-upload><small class="upload-hint">Image selection is preview-only in this static-data demo.</small></label><label class="full-span">CV / Resume <span class="optional">Optional demo field</span><input type="file" accept=".pdf,.doc,.docx" data-demo-upload><small class="upload-hint">File selection is preview-only; files are not uploaded to a server.</small></label></div><div class="onboarding-actions"><a class="text-link" href="<?=url('role')?>">← Change account type</a><button class="btn btn-dark" type="submit">Complete profile <span>↗</span></button></div></form></div></section>